        <h2>Cart recovery workflow test</h2>
        <p>These scenarios, notes and deep dives are illustrative planning models, not observed tests or verified vendor capabilities. Contribution = AOV × (margin − discount); discount loss = AOV × discount. Margin is the pre-discount gross margin, discount is a share of the original cart value, and product costs are held fixed; fees, shipping, returns and messaging costs are excluded. Proposed timings and branches require consent, quiet-hour, integration and suppression checks before use.</p>
        <p>$503 cart: email 45m / 31h / SMS 5h. $792 cart: adjust discount cap down 18% max. Exit on purchase; suppress OOS.</p>
        <h2>Channel escalation</h2>
